 "remarks": "Welcome to 25 Ludlow Manor, a spacious three-bedroom, two-full-bath single-family home offering approximately 1,800 square feet of comfortable living space. This inviting residence features abundant natural light, a bright sunroom, and charming wood details throughout. The flexible main-level bedroom and full bathroom are ideal for guests, a home office, or convenient one-level living. Upstairs includes two additional bedrooms, ample closet space, a full bathroom, and an office nook. Enjoy a private balcony overlooking the level, fenced-in backyard, along with generous basement storage. Conveniently located near the beach, parks, schools, Metro-North, restaurants, SoNo, I-95, and the Merritt Parkway. Available for $5,300 per month. Pets may be considered on a case-by-case basis.",
